.astro
# Keep any stray pnpm-workspace.yaml out of the build context. The Dockerfile
# does `COPY . .`, so a locally generated stub gets baked into the image, and
# the pnpm@9 pinned here rejects it ("packages field missing or empty"),
# failing `pnpm build` in start.sh and crash-looping the container.
# web/ is a standalone package and never needs a workspace manifest.
pnpm-workspace.yaml
